# Data dumps — NEVER commit these.
#
# On 2026-08-06 six near-duplicate email_resolution dumps (~817 MB) were
# committed here, which broke the Forgejo -> GitHub push mirror: GitHub
# rejects the 88.9 MB CSV outright, so every mirror sync has failed since
# 11:32Z that day. The repo is public on both hosts and these dumps are a
# ~946K-row author_email -> github_login dataset.
#
# Dumps are large binary-ish artifacts that belong in durable object storage
# (B2/ARMOR), not in git. Hand the *location* between beads, never the file.
# Canonical copies live at ~/backups/commitgraph-email-resolution-20260806/
# on ex44 (SHA256SUMS alongside).
email_resolution*.sql
email_resolution*.csv
dumps/
exports/
*.dump

# Agent trace logs — local only, never commit.
#
# bf writes one stdout capture per bead here. By 2026-08-06 that was 845 files
# totalling 350 MB, i.e. 94% of everything tracked, growing with every bead
# closed. They are machine-local debugging output with no cross-machine value
# that justifies the weight. Stripped from history on 2026-08-06; archived at
# ~/backups/commitgraph-prerewrite-20260806/beads-traces.tar.gz on ex44.
#
# This entry does NOT touch bead data itself — .beads/issues.jsonl and
# .beads/beads.db are still tracked and still authoritative.
.beads/traces/

# Compiled binaries
bin/
main
repo-admin
seed-author-login-cache
seed-email-resolution
validate-email-resolution
extract-sample-cache-data
containers/login-revalidation-worker/login-revalidation-worker

# Test coverage
coverage.out

